<title>USA: Sonat Inc Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Sonat Inc Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.78		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			 66,991		    7,410</p>
<p> Revs		   1,025,180		  579,334</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,280		   86,087</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.33		    $2.24</p>
<p> Net			201,189		  192,888</p>
<p> Revs		   3,394,898		1,990,141</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  86,211		   86,270</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 year and Q4 include a charge of $15 million, or $0.17 a share, from the impairment of oil and gas properties; $6.8 million, or $0.08 per share, on unrecoverable gas contract realignment costs; a loss of $5.5 million, or $0.06 a share from natural gas futures contracts.</p>
<p>1995 year includes a charge of $20 million, or $0.23 a share, from the sale of oil and gas properties; a gain of $24 million, or $0.28 a share, from terminations of long-term gas sales contracts; and a loss of $8 million, or $0.09 a share, related to the sale of the company's investment in Baker Hughes Inc convertible preferred stock.</p>
<p>(( -- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
